第三方算法与论文出处 (Third-Party Algorithms & Publications)
================================================================================

本项目遵循「零重写」原则: 数值重活与成熟算法直接复用已发表的世界级成果
与开源实现, 并在源码与 docs/REFERENCES.md 中逐条注明出处。核心引用如下:

  * Transformer / GPT
      - Vaswani, A. et al. "Attention Is All You Need." NeurIPS 2017.
      - Radford, A. et al. "Improving Language Understanding by Generative
        Pre-Training." 2018. (GPT-2)
  * FlashAttention-2
      - Dao, D. "FlashAttention-2: Faster Attention with Better Parallelism
        and Work Partitioning." 2023.
  * RoPE (旋转位置编码)
      - Su, J. et al. "RoFormer: Enhanced Transformer with Rotary Position
        Embedding." arXiv:2104.09864, 2021.
  * RMSNorm
      - Zhang, B. & Sennrich, R. "Root Mean Square Layer Normalization."
        arXiv:1910.07467, 2019.
  * SwiGLU / GLU 变体
      - Shazeer, N. "GLU Variants Improve Transformer." arXiv:2002.05202, 2020.
  * Llama 架构组合 (RMSNorm + SwiGLU + RoPE + GQA)
      - Touvron, H. et al. "LLaMA: Open and Efficient Foundation Language
        Models." arXiv:2302.13971, 2023.
  * FAVOR+ / Performer (正交随机特征线性注意力)
      - Choromanski, K. et al. "Rethinking Attention with Performers."
        arXiv:2009.14794, ICLR 2021.
  * 核化线性注意力
      - Katharopoulos, A. et al. "Transformers are RNNs: Fast Autoregressive
        Transformers with Linear Attention." ICML 2020.
  * Longformer (滑窗注意力)
      - Beltagy, I. et al. "Longformer: The Long-Document Transformer."
        arXiv:2004.05150, 2020.
  * Sparse Transformers (块状稀疏 + 全局 token)
      - Child, R. et al. "Generating Long Sequences with Sparse Transformers."
        arXiv:1904.10558, 2019.
  * BPE 分词
      - Sennrich, R. et al. "Neural Machine Translation of Rare Words with
        Subword Units." ACL 2016.
      - Sennrich, R. et al. "Unsupervised Machine Translation with
        Subword Units." 2015. (BPE 原始提出)
  * AdamW
      - Loshchilov, I. & Hutter, F. "Decoupled Weight Decay Regularization."
        ICLR 2019.
  * 余弦学习率调度 + 预热
      - Smith, L. et al. "No More Validation: Early Stopping for Synthetic
        Data Generation." 2020. / Goyal et al. "Accurate, Large Minibatch
        SGD: Training ImageNet in 1 Hour." 2017.
  * He 初始化
      - He, K. et al. "Delving Deep into Rectifiers." ICCV 2015.
  * 经典机器学习层 (PCA / GMM / KMeans / SVM / 朴素贝叶斯 / k-NN / 逻辑回归)
      - Tipping, M. E. & Bishop, C. M. "Probabilistic Principal Component
        Analysis." JRSS-B 1999.
      - Dempster, A. et al. "Maximum Likelihood from Incomplete Data via the
        EM Algorithm." JRSS-B 1977.
      - Lloyd, S. "Least Square Quantization in PCM." IEEE Trans. Comm. 1982.
      - Cortes, C. & Vapnik, V. "Support-Vector Networks." Machine Learning
        1995.
      - McCallum, P. & Nigam, K. "Employing EM in Pool-Based Active Learning
        for Text Classification." ICML 1998.
      - Cover, T. & Hart, P. "Nearest Neighbor Pattern Classification."
        IEEE TIT 1967.
  * 数值方法 (Jacobi 特征分解 / Cholesky / QR / logsumexp)
      - Jacobi, C. G. J. "Über ein neues Verfahren zur Berechnung der
        Eigenwerte eines quadratischen Form." 1846.
      - 高斯-约当消去法、Cholesky 分解等经典数值线性代数。
  * 交叉验证工具链
      - Harris, C. et al. "Array Programming with NumPy." Nature 2020.
      - Virtanen, P. et al. "SciPy 1.0." Nature Methods 2020.
      - Pedregosa, F. et al. "Scikit-learn: Machine Learning in Python."
        JMLR 2011.
      - Paszke, A. et al. "PyTorch: An Imperative Style, High-Performance
        Deep Learning Library." NeurIPS 2019.

